  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Before the explosion, the particle was moving along <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math>-axis i.e., it has no <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi></math>-component of velocity. Therefore, the centre of mass will not move in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi></math>-direction or we can say <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>cm</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>.<br /><br />Now,&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>y</mi><mtext>cm</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br />Therefore, &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>/</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>15</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>m</mi><mo>/</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mfenced></mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>/</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>m</mi><mo>/</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></mfrac></math><br /><br />or, &nbsp;&nbsp; <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>cm</mtext></math>",
